  "notes": "Entirely business-type entity (community college): College 2025 column used throughout; Foundation (component unit) columns and 2024 columns ignored. Basis GAAP (Statement of Revenues, Expenses and Changes in Net Position). No governmental funds, so governmental balances and reported_totals.governmental are null. reported_totals computed because no single total is printed. Other income (capital appropriations 3,135,960 + insurance proceeds 19,808) recorded in business_type.other_financing. Roll-forward: 60,837,928 + 44,359,588 - 37,110,027 + 3,155,768 = 71,243,257. Statement lists expenses by object only, so disbursement category is other with review; function split is in the General Fund expenditure schedule (budget basis, equipment expensed, not GASB) recorded in detail. Cash-flow statement is single column (College). Foundation net position end printed 7,598,516 on p2 vs 7,598,515 on p1 (not used). Read pages 1-6 of 6"
}
